<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Oct 1-15 palm oil exports 374,988 t-SGS.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Oct 1-15 palm oil exports 374,988 t-SGS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo surveyor Societe Generale de Surveillance (SGS) Malaysia Sdn Bhd said on Thursday it estimated Malaysia's palm oil exports for October 1-15 at 374,988 tonnes against 310,058 tonnes in September 1-15.</p>
<p>It said the exports comprised 95,463 tonnes of RBD palm oil, 155,110 tonnes of RBD palm olein and 42,132 tonnes of RBD palm stearin. The other products accounted for 82,283 tonnes.  </p>
<p>Pakistan was the main buyer during the period, taking 63,500 tonnes, followed by China (57,300 tonnes), India (53,140 tonnes) and United States (24,680 tonnes).</p>
<p>Countries in the European Union bought 65,874 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230-8911)</p>
</text>
